     [`improve-codebase-architecture`](../improve-codebase-architecture/SKILL.md);
     a specific seam or interface:
     [`codebase-design`](../codebase-design/SKILL.md).
   - Runnable design question: [`prototype`](../prototype/SKILL.md);
     primary-source reading: [`research`](../research/SKILL.md).
   - Create context for another session:
     [`handoff`](../handoff/SKILL.md). If the request supplies an existing
     handoff, validate it before loading its suggested skill.
   - Sustained learning: [`teach`](../teach/SKILL.md); agent-facing documents,
     including skills and `AGENTS.md`/`CLAUDE.md`:
     [`writing-for-agents`](../writing-for-agents/SKILL.md).
   - Article work: [`writing-fragments`](../writing-fragments/SKILL.md), then
     [`writing-beats`](../writing-beats/SKILL.md),
     [`writing-shape`](../writing-shape/SKILL.md) according to the current
     phase.
2. If these routes do not settle the choice, read the full
